                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Reminds me of the games you'd play as a kid on Newgrounds/armorgames/miniclip, etc. Someone handmade this little fun experience, you play it, like it, beat it, done. Its a series of turn based fights with simple party management (a few items, a few spells, a few equipables, and neat block/attack mechanics- you had to click and swipe through dots/arrows and how well you do that dictates if you miss, hit, crit, special effects, etc. pretty neat idea :)",
